rusqlite / libsqlite3-sys crates. See THIRD_PARTY.md for all dependencies
and their licenses.

SiftText modifies the pinned retrieval region in search.rs to reconcile
content-backed FTS5 postings incrementally inside a source-checked SQLite
transaction. Permission predicates and BM25 weights are invocation-local.
Stable UUID-to-rowid mapping additionally avoids unrelated posting rewrites
on insertion/deletion, preserving logical browse ordering and upstream query
ranking behavior. See THIRD_PARTY.md in this directory.
